122: | 0.2 | `lib/supabase/client.ts` | `createBrowserClient()` con env vars |
123: | 0.3 | `lib/supabase/server.ts` | `createServerClient()` para SSR |
124: | 0.4 | `lib/utils/constants.ts` | Design tokens, enums de estados, mapeo roles→rutas |
125: | 0.5 | `lib/utils/status.ts` | `getStatusColor()`, `getStatusLabel()`, `getPriorityColor()` |
126: | 0.6 | `lib/utils/roles.ts` | `canAccess(role, route)`, `canEditSolicitud(role, projectId, userProjects)`, `canCreateSolicitud(role, projectId, userProjects)` |
