 728:                     (UNIQUE person_id + project_id)
 729: 
 730: equipment ── id, spectrum_code, description, equipment_type, type_code,
 731: (UNIFICADA)  brand, model, serial_number, year, status, current_location,
 732:              plate, capacity, inspection_type, current_project_id→projects,
 733:              weight_class, acquisition_type, last_inspection_date,
 734:              next_inspection_due, meter_reading, insurance_expiry, notes,
 735:              parent_equipment_id→equipment (accesorio→padre)
